═══ mcp install ═══
putnami mcp install

Write the putnami entry into .mcp.json at the workspace root so agent IDEs (Claude Code, Cursor, VS Code) auto-discover the MCP server. init, install and upgrade already add a missing entry; this explicit write is the only one that also rewrites a diverged putnami entry. Merge-aware: other servers and unknown keys are preserved, and an unparseable file is refused untouched.

Usage:
  putnami mcp install

Examples:
  putnami mcp install

Global Options:
  Common: --verbose, --debug, --watch, --plan, --help
  Project Selection: --all, --impacted, --projects, --tag, --exclude-tag, --exclude, --baseline, --impacted-strict
